---
title: Context Compact Memory Flow
---
flowchart TD
  Request[Chat request] --> SM[SessionMemory.BuildMessages]
  SM --> RedisGet[mem.GetMessagesForRequest]
  RedisGet --> Keys[(Redis\nsys / summary / turns / meta)]
  Keys --> Budget[Trim turns to token budget]
  Budget --> Messages[sys + summary + turns + current user]
  Messages --> ADK[ADK run]
  ADK --> Before[compact.Middleware\nBeforeModelRewriteState]
  Before --> ToolBudget[toolresult.Apply\nspill large outputs]
  ToolBudget --> Manage[manageMessages\nsoft/hard threshold]
  Manage -->|under soft| Model[Model call]
  Manage -->|over threshold| Summary[summary model\ncompress prefix]
  Summary --> Model
  Manage -->|hard + summary failed| Drop[forceDropOldest note]
  Drop --> Model
  Model --> After[AfterModelRewriteState\nrecord prompt usage]
  ADK --> Answer[assistant answer]
  Answer --> Save[SessionMemory.SaveTurn]
  Save --> Set[mem.SetMessages]
  Set --> CompactHist[mem.CompactHistory\nold turns -> summary]
  CompactHist --> Keys
